    <main class="pk-drop-rules-copy">
      <section>
        <h2>1. Eligibility</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>You must play while signed in to Elixir Drop and have a Clash Royale player tag attached to your Drop profile.</li>
          <li>You must be old enough to participate under applicable law, at least 13, and live where Clash Royale is available through Supercell&rsquo;s official channels.</li>
          <li>You must be able to receive a gifted Pass Royale through Supercell ID. Supercell currently does not allow young player accounts under 16 to receive gifted passes.</li>
          <li>Your Clash Royale account must satisfy every current Supercell gifting requirement at delivery, including King Level, account age, friendship, and regional restrictions.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. How the winner is chosen</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>The challenge applies to the ranked game mode announced in Elixir Drop for that Clan Wars season.</li>
          <li>The season ends at the same moment as the Clan Wars season shown inside Elixir Drop.</li>
          <li>The valid player ranked #1 at that cutoff is the potential winner.</li>
          <li>If two results are exactly tied, the player who recorded that result first wins the tie.</li>
          <li>Standings remain provisional until the Fair Play review is complete.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Fair Play</h2>
        <p>Every answer must be deliberately chosen by a person through Elixir Drop&rsquo;s controls. Scripts, bots, automatic answer selection, direct API play, replayed requests, falsified timing evidence, and other automated assistance are not eligible.</p>
        <p>Automatic signals may start a review, but they do not decide it. A human referee reviews relevant evidence and makes the final eligibility decision. An excluded result leaves the board and the next eligible result moves into consideration.</p>
        <p><a href="https://drop.poapkings.com/fair-play/">Read Elixir Drop&rsquo;s full Fair Play policy →</a></p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Claiming the prize</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>POAP KINGS will email the potential winner at the address used to authenticate with Elixir Drop.</li>
          <li>The potential winner must reply within seven calendar days.</li>
          <li>The winner must complete the required Supercell ID friendship process so POAP KINGS can send the gift. Supercell currently requires the accounts to be friends for at least one day before a Pass Royale can be gifted.</li>
          <li>The winner is responsible for accepting the gift in Supercell ID within Supercell&rsquo;s claim window.</li>
          <li>If the potential winner does not reply, cannot receive the gift, or cannot complete delivery, the prize passes to the next-highest eligible player.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Prize</h2>
        <p>The prize is one Pass Royale sent as an in-game gift through Supercell ID. It has no cash alternative. POAP KINGS will never send cash, reimbursement, store credit, a different prize, or any other compensation in its place.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>6. Public results and privacy</h2>
        <p>Competition standings and the confirmed winner may show the player&rsquo;s Drop display name, Clash Royale player tag, and clan membership. The authentication email is private and is used only to operate the account and contact the potential winner.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>7. Organizer and changes</h2>
        <p>POAP KINGS funds and operates this challenge. Supercell does not create, sponsor, administer, or endorse it. POAP KINGS may correct an error, respond to abuse, or cancel a challenge when necessary to keep it lawful and fair. Material changes will be published on this page.</p>
        <p>Questions may be sent to <a href="mailto:drop@poapkings.com">drop@poapkings.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
